    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a pretty balanced view but i feel like it's kind of dodging the real question. if you look at the actual track record, they seem to fail way more often than they work, and they almost always hurt the regular people instead of the leaders. doesn't that basically mean the \"accountability\" argument is just a cover for imperialist bullying?",
